close_reason: "DELIVERED: merged PR #166 (fefa1c6d903ce46459f261e3b3b63fb64f458aa3) is an ancestor of audited main 7172186062a0398ffe585a593f7636a84b847671. Inspected on main: test/handoff.test.ts, docs/handoff-validation.md. Changed blockers invalidate acknowledgments, independent receivers preserve histories, missing evidence stays visible, and bounded native gitless SDK/CLI/public-copy and unchanged npm/Bun gates are delivered. This tracker audit inspected existing tests/files; it does not claim a new full product test run."
body: "Produce explicit questions, unresolved assumptions and required evidence with immutable packet revisions and independent receiver receipts. Existing brief prompt/since produce prose; core claims own work ownership; pm-memory owns standing knowledge; pm-context owns context delivery and since-delta. No since-delta implementation belongs here."
